    A["Assess the task"]
    B["Consequence: what happens if wrong?"]
    C["Volatility: how quickly can facts change?"]
    D["Uncertainty: how hard is correctness to establish?"]
    E["Reversibility: how hard is an error to undo?"]
    F{"Are stakes, uncertainty, or irreversibility high?"}
    G["Light check: scan for obvious errors"]
    H["Moderate check: compare with sources, examples, or repeated outputs"]
    I["Strong check: authoritative evidence and qualified human review"]
    J["Approval before action"]
    K["Use, verify, redesign, or stop"]

